based in Vevey</h3><ul class=\"ub\"><li>New construction</li><li>Advice before purchase</li><li>Building permit</li><li>Renovation</li><li>Feasibility study/outline</li><li>Call for tender</li><li>Interior architecture</li><li>Project</li><li>Work monitoring</li><li>Furniture design</li></ul><p>The agency works on various project scales for individuals, entrepreneurs and municipalities.</p><p>It relies on the architect-client dynamic as a design process.</p><p>We are concerned with an aesthetic highlighting the singularities of the site, the program and the client.</p><a class=\"c sb\" href=\"/contact-us\">Need our services? <span class=\"ac\">Contact us</span></a><div class=\"vb wg\"><div class=\"xg\"><a href=\"/chardonne-apartement-2024/17\"><img src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-appartement-chardonne-2024--17-thumbnail--©JulieMasson.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/chardonne-apartement-2024/26\"><img src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-appartement-chardonne-2024--26-thumbnail--©JulieMasson.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/grandvaux-villa-2023/30\"><img src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-villa-grandvaux-2023--30-thumbnail--©JulieMasson.jpg\"/></a></div><div class=\"xg\"><a href=\"/chardonne-apartement-2024/35\"><img src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-appartement-chardonne-2024--35-thumbnail--©JulieMasson.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/alpine-lamp/11\"><img src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-lampe-alpine--11-thumbnail--©JulieMasson.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/grandvaux-villa-2023/17\"><img src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-villa-grandvaux-2023--17-thumbnail--©JulieMasson.jpg\"/></a></div><div class=\"yg\">Photography<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.juliemasson.ch/\" target=\"_blank\">©JulieMasson</a></div></div><h2 class=\"wb\">Singularity as norm</h2><h3 class=\"xb\">Convinced that architecture has its source in specificities, Claire Duchamp defends projects designed in relation to the singularities of contexts and project owners.</h3><div class=\"yb\"><div class=\"zb\"><h3>Listening</h3><p>Listening and the architect-client dynamic are at the heart of the development process of our projects, in order to achieve a tailor-made and unique result.</p></div><div class=\"zb\"><h3>Reactivity</h3><p>We strive to demonstrate flexibility and open-mindedness to adapt as quickly as possible to challenges, unforeseen events and changes during the process.</p></div><div class=\"zb\"><h3>Singularity</h3><p>From detail to the whole, our transversal vision of the project allows us to think from the gesture to the typology through the atmospheres.</p><p>This process highlights your singularity.</p></div></div></div></article><footer class=\"re\"><div class=\"se\"><div class=\"te\"><div class=\"xe df\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/claire_duchamp_architecte/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ye df\">Instagram</a></div><div class=\"xe ef\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/claire-duchamp-4904b6a5\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ye ef\">LinkedIn</a></div></div><div class=\"we\"><div class=\"ue\"><div class=\"xe ze\"><a class=\"ye ze\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/legal-notice\">Legal notice</a></div><div class=\"xe af\"><a class=\"ye af\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy policy</a></div></div><div class=\"hf\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/b26oyumKkiTRXwmQA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ff\"><span class=\"gf\">Claire Duchamp Architecte</span><span class=\"gf\">Rue de la Clergère 2</span><span class=\"gf\">CH-1800 Vevey</span></a></div></div><div class=\"ve\"><div class=\"xe bf\">Photos: <a href=\"http://www.juliemasson.ch/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ye bf\">Julie Masson</a></div><div class=\"xe cf\">Website: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/adrien-febvay\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ye cf\">Adrien Febvay</a></div></div></div></footer><script>window.__staticRouterHydrationData = JSON.parse(\"{\\\"loaderData\\\":{\\\"0\\\":null,\\\"0-18\\\":null},\\\"actionData\\\":null,\\\"errors\\\":null}\");</script></div></body></html>","status":200}